sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Consumer stack
    participant K as Kubernetes API
    participant CM as cert-manager controller
    participant AP as approver-policy
    participant CA as ClusterIssuer internal-ca

    T->>K: Certificate keycloak-tls (ns keycloak)<br/>dnsNames: keycloak-service.keycloak.svc
    K->>CM: reconcile
    CM->>K: CertificateRequest
    K->>AP: evaluate against the CertificateRequestPolicies
    alt SANs under *.keycloak.svc and *.keycloak.svc.cluster.local
        AP->>K: Approved
        CM->>CA: sign
        CA-->>CM: certificate
        CM->>K: Secret keycloak-tls
    else a SAN from another namespace (e.g. *.sonarqube.svc)
        AP->>K: Denied with the reason
        Note over K: the Certificate never becomes Ready,<br/>platform alert after 15 min
    end
